# ---- Player-course advantage generated outputs (never commit) ----
# Ignore everything under data/player_course_advantage/ (rankings, backtests,
# analysis_runs/, private/raw|normalized|course_aliases|coverage|logs) ...
data/player_course_advantage/*
data/player_course_advantage/private/
data/player_course_advantage/analysis_runs/
# defensive filename guards for real data placed anywhere
**/normalized_history*.csv
**/*raw_hole_scores*.csv
**/course_aliases*.csv
# ... but DO commit the checked-in templates (docs/examples, no real data).
!data/player_course_advantage/templates/
!data/player_course_advantage/templates/**

